abstract: >-
  A new 18302-addition RUP certificate corroborates Pico's observation that
  the nonempty finite TenSystem remains inconsistent after deleting only
  downward closure. Two complete replays, a written encoding bridge,
  explicit weakened models, and rejecting controls are included.
  Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance; no formal verification, human
  peer review, or new Borsuk theorem is claimed.
